    "description": {
      "value": "This 6-foot-long scarf shimmers with the silvery light of the River of Souls while worn, providing illumination equivalent to that of a candle. You can deactivate or activate this radiance as an Interact action. The dangling lengths of a ghost scarf softly billow in the presence of haunts, granting the wearer a +1 item bonus to all Perception checks and Perception DCs to resolve discovering a haunt or rolling initiative when a haunt triggers.\n\n- **Activate:** 1 Action\n- **Frequency:** once per day\n\nThe scarf extends silvery threads that wrap around a weapon you carry, granting the effects of a ghost touch property rune to that weapon for 5 minutes. If the weapon already bears a ghost touch rune, you instead gain a +1 item bonus to Fortitude saves against effects from incorporeal undead for 5 minutes."
    },
